<p>Pahonche qareeb shehr-e-madina to ro diye<br>
Abid ka dil ghamo se bhar aaya to ro diye</p>

<p>Paao'n me aabile the, chale aur tehar gaye<br>
Rouza rasool ka nazar aaya to ro diye</p>

<p>Baithe zamee'n pa sar ko, jhukaye huwe imam<br>
saaya kiya kisi ne rida ka to ro diye</p>

<p>
Abbas ki wafa ka, shuja-at ka zikr tha<br>
Bete ne aake baap ko poocha to ro diye</p>

<p>
Ummul banee'n ko bete ka, pursa diya magar<br>
Sughra ko de sake na dilasa to ro diye</p>

<p>Farmate the shaheed, huwe aqruba tamaam<br>
Besheer ko kisi ne jo poocha to ro diye</p>

<p>
Roodaad karbala ki, sunaaya kiye imaam<br>
jab zikr shehr-e-shaam ka aaya to ro diye</p>

<p>Moula qamar nisaar, koi inteha bhi hai<br>
raato'n me roye din nikal aaya to ro diye</p>